KernelImmutableECDSA_Test
├── when verifyFallbackSignature receives a valid signature from the immutable signer
│   └── it should return validation success
├── when verifyFallbackSignature receives a signature from a different signer
│   └── it should return validation failed
├── when verifyFallbackSignature receives a malformed signature
│   └── it should return validation failed
├── when fallbackValidatorAvailable is checked
│   └── it should return true
├── when _initialize is called with empty packages
│   └── it should not revert and not set root
├── when _initialize is called with packages
│   └── it should install packages without requiring root
├── when initialize is called for the first time
│   └── it should succeed and initialize
└── when initialize is called a second time
    └── it should revert with InvalidInitialization
